1
00:00:06,873 --> 00:00:10,143
(Star Wars fanfare playing)

2
00:00:49,816 --> 00:00:52,086
♪ ♪

3
00:00:58,363 --> 00:01:00,463
Guys, tickets already went on sale!
What?!

4
00:01:00,465 --> 00:01:02,265
(Howard:)They're not supposed
to be available yet.

5
00:01:02,267 --> 00:01:03,937
(Leonard:)I don't know what to tell
you, but they're on sale!

6
00:01:03,935 --> 00:01:06,405
What? Wait. You're sure
they're Star Wars tickets?

7
00:01:06,404 --> 00:01:10,574
No, it's Steel Magnolias 2:
Even Steelier.

8
00:01:11,776 --> 00:01:13,106
(Sheldon:)The Web site's frozen.
I can't get in!

9
00:01:13,111 --> 00:01:14,541
LEONARD: Yeah, me, too.
WOLOWITZ: Same here!

10
00:01:14,546 --> 00:01:16,816
Guys, they're gonna sell out!
What are we gonna do?!

11
00:01:16,814 --> 00:01:19,044
(Sheldon:)All right, this goes
against everything I stand for,

12
00:01:19,050 --> 00:01:21,380
(Sheldon:)but desperate times call
for desperate measures.

13
00:01:21,386 --> 00:01:23,086
(Sheldon:)Lord...

14
00:01:24,889 --> 00:01:26,889
(Sheldon:)This is Sheldon Cooper.

15
00:01:26,891 --> 00:01:29,561
(Sheldon:)You're good friends with my mom.

16
00:01:29,561 --> 00:01:33,191
(Sheldon:)I know I've spent my life
denying that you exist.

17
00:01:33,197 --> 00:01:35,597
Got 'em!
And I will continue to do so!

18
00:01:37,001 --> 00:01:40,601
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

